SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5 charge
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn 1

RATES
Calcite
-start
10 k = 0.001
20 ssa = 10.0
30 rate = k*ssa
40 moles = rate * TIME
50 SAVE moles
-end

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1.0
        -m 1.0
        -steps 10 in 100
        -cvode false

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_kinetics.sel
    -time true
    -totals C
    -kinetic_reactants Calcite
    -step true
END